# Not needed for local work: `pnpm db:migrate` runs through `neon-env run`, which
# injects the linked Neon branch's DATABASE_URL_UNPOOLED (see `.neon`, `neon checkout`).
#
# Optional explicit override (e.g. CI with a dedicated migrator role). Export it in the
# shell/CI environment — this file is not loaded. NEVER commit real credentials.
# DATABASE_URL_MIGRATIONS="postgresql://migrator:<password>@ep-xxx.region.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require&channel_binding=require"
